CardPreview's outer min-h-screen wrapper now that Layout\n  owns the page chrome.","tree":{"sha":"5f786df72bbc5dbc9eb7ad58cb54cfcfdb1bc646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/git/trees/5f786df72bbc5dbc9eb7ad58cb54cfcfdb1bc646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/git/commits/5a54d054b1d617793a13ee9a4f99312bf69606a7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJtL2fRW\nLpar6xME8rM5A/noYUDLjbMaYYWue5R4ZC2OpuW6jAmGDb8uJzX+hMt8Ba3QnBhvKf09XPONZ7yF\nFwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 5f786df72bbc5dbc9eb7ad58cb54cfcfdb1bc646\nparent bd93bc1a56fc9117f39dc049b4d2955bda329549\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778246848 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778246848 +0000\n\nfeat(signal): add /signals hub page; unify all surfaces under one app shell\n\n- Adds SignalsHub at /signals — a landing page with three entry cards\n  (Teams card preview, investigation console, control / regression view)\n  plus a summary of the active demo Signal and a direct-route reference\n  list. Reviewers can now walk the demo end-to-end from one page.\n- Wraps /preview/teams-card in Layout so the TopNav stays present on the\n  preview surface (was previously chrome-less).\n- Renames the TopNav entry 'Signal Preview' → 'Signals' and points it at\n  /signals. The hub is the new front door for the demo.\n- Trims TeamsCardPreview's outer min-h-screen wrapper now that Layout\n  owns the page chrome.\n","verified_at":"2026-05-08T13:27:35Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/commits/5a54d054b1d617793a13ee9a4f99312bf69606a7","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/commit/5a54d054b1d617793a13ee9a4f99312bf69606a7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashja