\n  supplier detail, auto-scrolls the matching risk lens panel into view,\n  and highlights the lens row. Acknowledging persists per-signal in\n  localStorage (radar.signal.ack.<signal_id>) and removes the banner.\n  Without ?signal, the screen is unchanged.\n\nRiskLensChart gains an optional highlightLens prop (default null), so\nexisting screens render identically. No new colour variables, fonts,\nor component libraries; severity surfaces mirror AlertCard's pattern.","tree":{"sha":"11eb1190eddc17bbbd04e3d8a6371f8c0564c412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/git/trees/11eb1190eddc17bbbd04e3d8a6371f8c0564c412"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/git/commits/d0a7f2743a9b487031ee4737265d4537e2f3a1ac","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEQWtF5Y\n7i9oehuCulW9f+uft5cy6EsqvUYoWpyL3v5T0nOOYIaO3Lf1B7T8BDJyzOmIaEPZ4Tv+GNDCNBmE\nYg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 11eb1190eddc17bbbd04e3d8a6371f8c0564c412\nparent aa58c680f91df9cda5a2dd0496ca889d3651fdaa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778243275 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778243275 +0000\n\nfeat(signal): add Teams card preview + investigation console banner\n\nTwo new surfaces consume the Signal contract:\n\n- /preview/teams-card renders a standalone Teams-channel preview of the\n  RADAR Signal (sender/channel chrome, severity stripe, score delta,\n  revenue at risk, three-bucket impact tag, ranked recommendations,\n  Acknowledge + Investigate CTAs). Standalone route, no Layout chrome.\n\n- /supplier/:id?signal=:signalId pins a SignalBanner above the existing\n  supplier detail, auto-scrolls the matching risk lens panel into view,\n  and highlights the lens row. Acknowledging persists per-signal in\n  localStorage (radar.signal.ack.<signal_id>) and removes the banner.\n  Without ?signal, the screen is unchanged.\n\nRiskLensChart gains an optional highlightLens prop (default null), so\nexisting screens render identically. No new colour variables, fonts,\nor component libraries; severity surfaces mirror AlertCard's pattern.\n","verified_at":"2026-05-08T12:28:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/commits/d0a7f2743a9b487031ee4737265d4537e2f3a1ac","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/commit/d0a7f2743a9b487031ee4737265d4537e2f3a1ac","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/RADAR-UI/commits/d0a7f2743a9b487031ee4737265d4537e2f3a1ac/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h